---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import bgpLogo from '../assets/bgp-logo.png';
import penesonLogo from '../assets/peneson-logo.png';
---

<Layout title="About Us | OceanHub" description="OceanHub is the ecosystem platform for marine data services, orchestrating the transition to a blue energy future.">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="relative py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6">
				Orchestrating the <span class="text-blue-400">Blue Energy</span> Transition
			</h1>
			<p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				The ocean is the next frontier for global energy, but it remains a complex and hostile environment. OceanHub was born to bridge this gap.
			</p>
		</div>
		<!-- Abstract Background -->
		<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
			<svg class="h-full w-full" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
				<path d="M0 100 C 20 0 50 0 100 100 Z" fill="white" />
			</svg>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Main Narrative -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-white">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="prose prose-lg text-slate-600 mx-auto">
				<p class="lead text-2xl font-medium text-slate-900 mb-8">
					OceanHub is building a <strong>green technology ecosystem</strong> dedicated to the vision of "Bridging Data, Energy & Future".
				</p>
				<p>
					The challenge of the energy transition—from offshore wind scale-up to gigaton-scale CCS—is too vast for any single entity to solve alone. It requires a new collaborative model.
				</p>
				<p>
					We integrate global resources, local expertise, and cross-domain innovation. By connecting energy developers with a diverse network of specialized technology partners (like BGP Offshore and Peneson), we provide the <strong>Deep Blue Intelligence</strong> needed to navigate the unknown.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Our Values -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="text-center mb-16">
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our Core Values</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 mt-4">The principles that guide our ecosystem.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
				<!-- Value 1 -->
				<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
						🔗
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Integration</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-500">
						We break down silos. By fusing geophysics and geotechnics, we provide a unified ground model that eliminates uncertainty and streamlines project timelines.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Value 2 -->
				<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
						🚀
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Innovation</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-500">
						We champion "Smart MRV". From autonomous USV swarms to fiber-optic well monitoring, we deploy the right technology to lower costs and increase precision.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Value 3 -->
				<div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all">
					<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-2xl">
						🌱
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Sustainability</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-500">
						Our mission is impact. Every survey we conduct and every dataset we deliver is aimed at accelerating the global transition to net-zero energy.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Thought Leadership -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Amplifying the Industry Voice</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						OceanHub is more than a service provider; we are a <strong>community builder</strong>. We believe that solving the energy trilemma requires open dialogue, shared knowledge, and cross-border collaboration.
					</p>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
						We actively curate and organize industry-defining events like <strong>Ocean Talks</strong>, bringing together geophysicists, engineers, and policymakers to debate the technical and regulatory challenges of the blue economy. By fostering these conversations, we turn individual insights into collective progress.
					</p>
					<a href="https://rio25.sbgf.org.br/Pages/oceanHub.php" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 font-bold hover:text-blue-800 transition-colors">
						See our work at SBGf Rio 25 <span class="ml-2">&rarr;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-blue-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
					<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mt-10 -mr-10 w-40 h-40 bg-blue-500 rounded-full opacity-20 blur-3xl"></div>
					<div class="relative z-10">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">"OceanTalks" Initiative</h3>
						<p class="text-blue-100 mb-6 italic">
							"Creating a space where the technical rigour of geophysics meets the strategic urgency of the energy transition."
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-3">
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<span class="text-blue-400 mt-1">•</span>
								<span>Curating high-level technical sessions</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<span class="text-blue-400 mt-1">•</span>
								<span>Bridging academia and industry</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
								<span class="text-blue-400 mt-1">•</span>
								<span>Advocating for standardized marine data</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Our Ecosystem DNA -->
	<section class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">An Open Ecosystem</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
				We are building a collaborative network that spans the entire marine value chain. From geophysical giants to agile tech startups, OceanHub integrates the best-in-class capabilities to solve complex energy challenges.
			</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-16 opacity-80">
				<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
					<Image src={bgpLogo} alt="BGP Offshore" width={180} class="grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all" />
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Geophysical Partner</span>
				</div>
				<div class="h-12 w-px bg-slate-200 hidden md:block"></div>
				<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
					<Image src={penesonLogo} alt="Guangzhou Peneson" width={180} class="grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all" />
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Geotechnical Partner</span>
				</div>
				<div class="h-12 w-px bg-slate-200 hidden md:block"></div>
				<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
					<div class="w-[180px] h-[60px] flex items-center justify-center border border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">
						Your Logo Here
					</div>
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Join the Alliance</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
